OL,3,GNEWSAGuernsey: Microsoft outage causes
OL,4,Adisruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FDisruption to services across Guernsey
OL,7,Fis easing following a Microsoft global
OL,8,Foutage.
OL,10,FTeams, Outlook and AI software Copilot
OL,11,Fwere affected by the issue which lasted
OL,12,Fmore than 20 hours. More than 400
OL,13,Fmillion people are known to use
OL,14,FMicrosoft 365 services.
OL,16,FIn a post on social media, Guernsey's
OL,17,Fairline Aurigny warned the outage may
OL,18,Fhave affected some of its communication
OL,19,Fchannels, and it advised customers to
OL,20,Fmanually take notes of their details
OL,21,Fwhilst making a booking.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
