OL,3,GNEWSAGuernsey: Microsoft outage causes
OL,4,Adisruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe States of Guernsey said emails were
OL,7,Fbeing sent and received intermittently,
OL,8,Fadding it would provide an update about
OL,9,Fthe ongoing impact of the global issue
OL,10,Fwhen it found out more.
